"This permanently deletes your account and everything in it: properties, "
"tenants, leases, meter readings, payment notices and payments. Any paid "
"subscription is cancelled. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Tiks neatgriezeniski dzēsts jūsu konts un viss tajā: īpašumi, īrnieki, "
"līgumi, skaitītāju rādījumi, maksājuma paziņojumi un maksājumi. Maksas "
"abonements tiks atcelts. To nevarēs atsaukt."

